{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01017","headline":"横吹曲辞 骢马 · 李羣玉","name":"横吹曲辞 骢马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮云何权奇，绝足势未知。\n长嘶青海风，躞蹀振云丝。\n由来渥洼种，本是苍龙儿。\n穆满不再活，无人崑阆骑。\n君识跃峤怯，宁劳耀金羁。\n青刍与白水，空笑驽骀肥。\n伯乐傥一见，应惊耳长垂。\n当思八荒外，逐日向瑶池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01017.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01017","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}